  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF Images Extractor extracts the images embedded in PDF documents - all pages or a range - to files or, through an event, to your code.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for 64-bit (x64) applications; for x86 and AnyCPU applications use ExpertPdf.PdfImgExtract.\n\nFeatures\n- Extract the images of all pages or a range of pages\n- Save them as PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF or TIFF files, with a file name prefix\n- Or receive each image in memory with the ImageExtractedEvent event\n- Password protected documents; document information",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
