  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0: MinimumWidth / MinimumHeight filters, extraction to memory (ExtractImagesToMemory), SkipDuplicateImages. Version 10 is part of the ExpertPdf 22.0 release: it requires a version 10 license key.",
